[{"id":"jaa-2-89-1","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"došao im je","en":"he/it came to them"},{"bs":"i došla mu je","en":"and she/it came to him"},{"bs":"pa ju je natjerao","en":"so he/it drove her"},{"bs":"i došli su","en":"and they came"}],"ref":"2:89","answerWord":"جَآءَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/1361d6be63c1e609c2fe.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when there cometh unto them a scripture from Allah, confirming that in their possession - though before that they were asking for a signal triumph over those who disbelieved - and when there cometh unto them that which they know (to be the truth) they disbelieve therein. The curse of Allah is on disbelievers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["وَلَمَّا","جَآءَهُمْ","كِتَٰبٌ","مِّنْ","عِندِ","ٱللَّهِ","مُصَدِّقٌ","لِّمَا","مَعَهُمْ","وَكَانُوا۟","مِن","قَبْلُ","يَسْتَفْتِحُونَ","عَلَى","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","فَلَمَّا","جَآءَهُم","مَّا","عَرَفُوا۟","كَفَرُوا۟","بِهِۦ","فَلَعْنَةُ","ٱللَّهِ","عَلَى","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-2-89-17","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"došao im je","en":"he/it came to them"},{"bs":"došla vam je","en":"she/it came to you (all)"},{"bs":"i došla im je","en":"and she/it came to them"},{"bs":"došli su","en":"they came"}],"ref":"2:89","answerWord":"جَآءَهُم","answerSound":"audio/3a680bad80009be22e44.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when there cometh unto them a scripture from Allah, confirming that in their possession - though before that they were asking for a signal triumph over those who disbelieved - and when there cometh unto them that which they know (to be the truth) they disbelieve therein. The curse of Allah is on disbelievers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["وَلَمَّا","جَآءَهُمْ","كِتَٰبٌ","مِّنْ","عِندِ","ٱللَّهِ","مُصَدِّقٌ","لِّمَا","مَعَهُمْ","وَكَانُوا۟","مِن","قَبْلُ","يَسْتَفْتِحُونَ","عَلَى","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","فَلَمَّا","جَآءَهُم","مَّا","عَرَفُوا۟","كَفَرُوا۟","بِهِۦ","فَلَعْنَةُ","ٱللَّهِ","عَلَى","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-2-87-17","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"došao vam je","en":"he/it came to you (all)"},{"bs":"učinila si","en":"you did"},{"bs":"učinili ste","en":"you (all) did"},{"bs":"pa mu je došla","en":"so she/it came to him"}],"ref":"2:87","answerWord":"جَآءَكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/25e398d995b51f353dab.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And verily We gave unto Moses the Scripture and We caused a train of messengers to follow after him, and We gave unto Jesus, son of Mary, clear proofs (of Allah's sovereignty), and We supported him with the Holy spirit. Is it ever so, that, when there cometh unto you a messenger (from Allah) with that which ye yourselves desire not, ye grow arrogant, and some ye disbelieve and some ye slay?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","ءَاتَيْنَا","مُوسَى","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","وَقَفَّيْنَا","مِنۢ","بَعْدِهِۦ","بِٱلرُّسُلِ","وَءَاتَيْنَا","عِيسَى","ٱبْنَ","مَرْيَمَ","ٱلْبَيِّنَٰتِ","وَأَيَّدْنَٰهُ","بِرُوحِ","ٱلْقُدُسِ","أَفَكُلَّمَا","جَآءَكُمْ","رَسُولٌۢ","بِمَا","لَا","تَهْوَىٰٓ","أَنفُسُكُمُ","ٱسْتَكْبَرْتُمْ","فَفَرِيقًا","كَذَّبْتُمْ","وَفَرِيقًا","تَقْتُلُونَ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-3-19-14","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"došao im je","en":"he/it came to them"},{"bs":"došla mu je","en":"she/it came to it"},{"bs":"zar si nam došao?","en":"did you come to us?"},{"bs":"došli su vam","en":"they came to you (all)"}],"ref":"3:19","answerWord":"جَآءَهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/1a9564e2cc803a531a12.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! religion with Allah (is) the Surrender (to His Will and Guidance). Those who (formerly) received the Scripture differed only after knowledge came unto them, through transgression among themselves. Whoso disbelieveth the revelations of Allah (will find that) lo! Allah is swift at reckoning.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلدِّينَ","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","ٱلْإِسْلَٰمُ","وَمَا","ٱخْتَلَفَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أُوتُوا۟","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","إِلَّا","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَا","جَآءَهُمُ","ٱلْعِلْمُ","بَغْيًۢا","بَيْنَهُمْ","وَمَن","يَكْفُرْ","بِـَٔايَٰتِ","ٱللَّهِ","فَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","سَرِيعُ","ٱلْحِسَابِ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-2-92-1","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"došao vam je","en":"he/it came to you (all)"},{"bs":"došao im je","en":"he/it came to them"},{"bs":"došla im je","en":"she/it came to them"},{"bs":"došla mu je","en":"she/it came to it"}],"ref":"2:92","answerWord":"جَآءَكُم","answerSound":"audio/e5ce4e0d320e26d40882.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Moses came unto you with clear proofs (of Allah's Sovereignty), yet, while he was away, ye chose the calf (for worship) and ye were wrong-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","جَآءَكُم","مُّوسَىٰ","بِٱلْبَيِّنَٰتِ","ثُمَّ","ٱتَّخَذْتُمُ","ٱلْعِجْلَ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِهِۦ","وَأَنتُمْ","ظَٰلِمُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-7-113-0","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"i došao je","en":"and he/it came"},{"bs":"došao mi je","en":"he/it came to me"},{"bs":"došla mu je","en":"she/it came to it"},{"bs":"učinili ste","en":"you (all) did"}],"ref":"7:113","answerWord":"وَجَآءَ","answerSound":"audio/1b6c2a21a329fda3c6d2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And the wizards came to Pharaoh, saying: Surely there will be a reward for us if we are victors.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["وَجَآءَ","ٱلسَّحَرَةُ","فِرْعَوْنَ","قَالُوٓا۟","إِنَّ","لَنَا","لَأَجْرًا","إِن","كُنَّا","نَحْنُ","ٱلْغَٰلِبِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-6-109-18","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"došla je","en":"she/it came"},{"bs":"i došao im je","en":"and he/it came to them"},{"bs":"donijeli smo","en":"we brought"},{"bs":"i došao sam ti","en":"and I came to you"}],"ref":"6:109","answerWord":"جَآءَتْ","answerSound":"audio/be2c7f94cd5efb51ea92.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they swear a solemn oath by Allah that if there come unto them a portent they will believe therein. Say; Portents are with Allah and (so is) that which telleth you that if such came unto them they would not believe.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["وَأَقْسَمُوا۟","بِٱللَّهِ","جَهْدَ","أَيْمَٰنِهِمْ","لَئِن","جَآءَتْهُمْ","ءَايَةٌ","لَّيُؤْمِنُنَّ","بِهَا","قُلْ","إِنَّمَا","ٱلْءَايَٰتُ","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَمَا","يُشْعِرُكُمْ","أَنَّهَآ","إِذَا","جَآءَتْ","لَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-3-184-7","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"došli su","en":"they came"},{"bs":"došao sam ti","en":"I came to you"},{"bs":"došla im je","en":"she/it came to them"},{"bs":"došla je","en":"she/it came"}],"ref":"3:184","answerWord":"جَآءُو","answerSound":"audio/e1384c41966245e336d9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if they deny thee, even so did they deny messengers who were before thee, who came with miracles and with the Psalms and with the Scripture giving light.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["فَإِن","كَذَّبُوكَ","فَقَدْ","كُذِّبَ","رُسُلٌ","مِّن","قَبْلِكَ","جَآءُو","بِٱلْبَيِّنَٰتِ","وَٱلزُّبُرِ","وَٱلْكِتَٰبِ","ٱلْمُنِيرِ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-5-19-14","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"došao nam je","en":"he/it came to us"},{"bs":"došli smo im","en":"we came to them"},{"bs":"pa je došao","en":"so he/it came"},{"bs":"došao si","en":"you came"}],"ref":"5:19","answerWord":"جَآءَنَا","answerSound":"audio/63dc5311a178553af450.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O People of the Scripture! Now hath Our messenger come unto you to make things plain unto you after an interval (of cessation) of the messengers, lest ye should say: There came not unto us a messenger of cheer nor any warner. Now hath a messenger of cheer and a warner come unto you. Allah is Able to do all things.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَهْلَ","ٱلْكِتَٰبِ","قَدْ","جَآءَكُمْ","رَسُولُنَا","يُبَيِّنُ","لَكُمْ","عَلَىٰ","فَتْرَةٍ","مِّنَ","ٱلرُّسُلِ","أَن","تَقُولُوا۟","مَا","جَآءَنَا","مِنۢ","بَشِيرٍ","وَلَا","نَذِيرٍ","فَقَدْ","جَآءَكُم","بَشِيرٌ","وَنَذِيرٌ","وَٱللَّهُ","عَلَىٰ","كُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","قَدِيرٌ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-2-71-18","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"došao si","en":"you came"},{"bs":"učinili ste","en":"you (all) did"},{"bs":"i došla im je","en":"and she/it came to them"},{"bs":"došao vam je","en":"he/it came to you (all)"}],"ref":"2:71","answerWord":"جِئْتَ","answerSound":"audio/fc3aa6ed071704df2431.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(Moses) answered: Lo! He saith: Verily she is a cow unyoked; she plougheth not the soil nor watereth the tilth; whole and without mark. They said: Now thou bringest the truth. So they sacrificed her, though almost they did not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["قَالَ","إِنَّهُۥ","يَقُولُ","إِنَّهَا","بَقَرَةٌ","لَّا","ذَلُولٌ","تُثِيرُ","ٱلْأَرْضَ","وَلَا","تَسْقِى","ٱلْحَرْثَ","مُسَلَّمَةٌ","لَّا","شِيَةَ","فِيهَا","قَالُوا۟","ٱلْـَٰٔنَ","جِئْتَ","بِٱلْحَقِّ","فَذَبَحُوهَا","وَمَا","كَادُوا۟","يَفْعَلُونَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-4-62-8","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"došli su ti","en":"they came to you"},{"bs":"i došao im je","en":"and he/it came to them"},{"bs":"došao joj je","en":"he/it came to it"},{"bs":"pa su im došli","en":"so they came to them"}],"ref":"4:62","answerWord":"جَآءُوكَ","answerSound":"audio/25ebcba4c655819e44bc.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"How would it be if a misfortune smote them because of that which their own hands have sent before (them)? Then would they come unto thee, swearing by Allah that they were seeking naught but harmony and kindness.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["فَكَيْفَ","إِذَآ","أَصَٰبَتْهُم","مُّصِيبَةٌۢ","بِمَا","قَدَّمَتْ","أَيْدِيهِمْ","ثُمَّ","جَآءُوكَ","يَحْلِفُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","إِنْ","أَرَدْنَآ","إِلَّآ","إِحْسَٰنًا","وَتَوْفِيقًا"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-20-57-1","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"zar si nam došao?","en":"did you come to us?"},{"bs":"pa je došao","en":"so he/it came"},{"bs":"učinili ste","en":"you (all) did"},{"bs":"došla vam je","en":"she/it came to you (all)"}],"ref":"20:57","answerWord":"أَجِئْتَنَا","answerSound":"audio/c622addfa60d3e39a814.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Hast come to drive us out from our land by thy magic, O Moses?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["قَالَ","أَجِئْتَنَا","لِتُخْرِجَنَا","مِنْ","أَرْضِنَا","بِسِحْرِكَ","يَٰمُوسَىٰ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-4-41-2","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"donijeli smo","en":"we brought"},{"bs":"došao si im","en":"you came to them"},{"bs":"zar si nam došao?","en":"did you come to us?"},{"bs":"došli smo vam","en":"we came to you (all)"}],"ref":"4:41","answerWord":"جِئْنَا","answerSound":"audio/8976302c76c0ef147dd2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But how (will it be with them) when We bring of every people a witness, and We bring thee (O Muhammad) a witness against these?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["فَكَيْفَ","إِذَا","جِئْنَا","مِن","كُلِّ","أُمَّةٍۭ","بِشَهِيدٍ","وَجِئْنَا","بِكَ","عَلَىٰ","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","شَهِيدًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-4-170-3","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"došao vam je","en":"he/it came to you (all)"},{"bs":"došla im je","en":"she/it came to them"},{"bs":"došli smo im","en":"we came to them"},{"bs":"zar si nam došao?","en":"did you come to us?"}],"ref":"4:170","answerWord":"جَآءَكُمُ","answerSound":"audio/4db9b021e72e53a9ee05.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O mankind! The messenger hath come unto you with the Truth from your Lord. Therefor believe; (it is) better for you. But if ye disbelieve, still, lo! unto Allah belongeth whatsoever is in the heavens and the earth. Allah is ever Knower, Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلنَّاسُ","قَدْ","جَآءَكُمُ","ٱلرَّسُولُ","بِٱلْحَقِّ","مِن","رَّبِّكُمْ","فَـَٔامِنُوا۟","خَيْرًا","لَّكُمْ","وَإِن","تَكْفُرُوا۟","فَإِنَّ","لِلَّهِ","مَا","فِى","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","وَكَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","عَلِيمًا","حَكِيمًا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-4-41-7","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"i donijeli smo","en":"and we brought"},{"bs":"pa ju je natjerao","en":"so he/it drove her"},{"bs":"došao vam je","en":"he/it came to you (all)"},{"bs":"došao je","en":"he/it came"}],"ref":"4:41","answerWord":"وَجِئْنَا","answerSound":"audio/5fa3c67949907caa5d7b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But how (will it be with them) when We bring of every people a witness, and We bring thee (O Muhammad) a witness against these?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["فَكَيْفَ","إِذَا","جِئْنَا","مِن","كُلِّ","أُمَّةٍۭ","بِشَهِيدٍ","وَجِئْنَا","بِكَ","عَلَىٰ","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","شَهِيدًا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-12-19-0","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"i došla je","en":"and she/it came"},{"bs":"došao je","en":"he/it came"},{"bs":"došla im je","en":"she/it came to them"},{"bs":"učinila si","en":"you did"}],"ref":"12:19","answerWord":"وَجَآءَتْ","answerSound":"audio/570e2c7ee0987c9429b8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And there came a caravan, and they sent their waterdrawer. He let down his pail (into the pit). He said: Good luck! Here is a youth. And they hid him as a treasure, and Allah was Aware of what they did.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["وَجَآءَتْ","سَيَّارَةٌ","فَأَرْسَلُوا۟","وَارِدَهُمْ","فَأَدْلَىٰ","دَلْوَهُۥ","قَالَ","يَٰبُشْرَىٰ","هَٰذَا","غُلَٰمٌ","وَأَسَرُّوهُ","بِضَٰعَةً","وَٱللَّهُ","عَلِيمٌۢ","بِمَا","يَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-15-63-2","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"došli smo ti","en":"we came to you"},{"bs":"i došli su","en":"and they came"},{"bs":"došli smo im","en":"we came to them"},{"bs":"učinila si","en":"you did"}],"ref":"15:63","answerWord":"جِئْنَٰكَ","answerSound":"audio/29f8867a8a3926d76d5f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: Nay, but we bring thee that concerning which they keep disputing,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","بَلْ","جِئْنَٰكَ","بِمَا","كَانُوا۟","فِيهِ","يَمْتَرُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-3-86-11","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"i došao im je","en":"and he/it came to them"},{"bs":"i došao ti je","en":"and he/it came to you"},{"bs":"došla mu je","en":"she/it came to it"},{"bs":"došli su vam","en":"they came to you (all)"}],"ref":"3:86","answerWord":"وَجَآءَهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/591d38a9bfdb0c802d7a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"How shall Allah guide a people who disbelieved after their belief and (after) they bore witness that the messenger is true and after clear proofs (of Allah's Sovereignty) had come unto them. And Allah guideth not wrongdoing folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["كَيْفَ","يَهْدِى","ٱللَّهُ","قَوْمًا","كَفَرُوا۟","بَعْدَ","إِيمَٰنِهِمْ","وَشَهِدُوٓا۟","أَنَّ","ٱلرَّسُولَ","حَقٌّ","وَجَآءَهُمُ","ٱلْبَيِّنَٰتُ","وَٱللَّهُ","لَا","يَهْدِى","ٱلْقَوْمَ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-6-94-1","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"došli ste nam","en":"you (all) came to us"},{"bs":"došla vam je","en":"she/it came to you (all)"},{"bs":"i došao mu je","en":"and he/it came to him"},{"bs":"učinili ste","en":"you (all) did"}],"ref":"6:94","answerWord":"جِئْتُمُونَا","answerSound":"audio/ef8df3e3c05f8f414bea.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Now have ye come unto Us solitary as We did create you at the first, and ye have left behind you all that We bestowed upon you, and We behold not with you those your intercessors, of whom ye claimed that they possessed a share in you. Now is the bond between you severed, and that which ye presumed hath failed you.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","جِئْتُمُونَا","فُرَٰدَىٰ","كَمَا","خَلَقْنَٰكُمْ","أَوَّلَ","مَرَّةٍ","وَتَرَكْتُم","مَّا","خَوَّلْنَٰكُمْ","وَرَآءَ","ظُهُورِكُمْ","وَمَا","نَرَىٰ","مَعَكُمْ","شُفَعَآءَكُمُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","زَعَمْتُمْ","أَنَّهُمْ","فِيكُمْ","شُرَكَٰٓؤُا۟","لَقَد","تَّقَطَّعَ","بَيْنَكُمْ","وَضَلَّ","عَنكُم","مَّا","كُنتُمْ","تَزْعُمُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"jaa-7-116-8","words":["verb:jaa"],"options":[{"bs":"i došli su","en":"and they came"},{"bs":"došao vam je","en":"he/it came to you (all)"},{"bs":"i došao ti je","en":"and he/it came to you"},{"bs":"došla nam je","en":"she/it came to us"}],"ref":"7:116","answerWord":"وَجَآءُو","answerSound":"audio/4d94be983385557150bc.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Throw! And when they threw they cast a spell upon the people's eyes, and overawed them, and produced a mighty spell.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"doći","en":"to come"},"passage":["قَالَ","أَلْقُوا۟","فَلَمَّآ","أَلْقَوْا۟","سَحَرُوٓا۟","أَعْيُنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","وَٱسْتَرْهَبُوهُمْ","وَجَآءُو","بِسِحْرٍ","عَظِيمٍ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"جاءَ"}},{"id":"najja-11-58-3","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"spasili smo","en":"we saved"},{"bs":"spašava vas","en":"he/it saves you (all)"},{"bs":"spasio ih je","en":"he/it saved them"},{"bs":"spašavamo te","en":"we save you"}],"ref":"11:58","answerWord":"نَجَّيْنَا","answerSound":"audio/8d20f87246b0151591f7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when Our commandment came to pass We saved Hud and those who believed with him by a mercy from Us; We saved them from a harsh doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["وَلَمَّا","جَآءَ","أَمْرُنَا","نَجَّيْنَا","هُودًا","وَٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","مَعَهُۥ","بِرَحْمَةٍ","مِّنَّا","وَنَجَّيْنَٰهُم","مِّنْ","عَذَابٍ","غَلِيظٍ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-21-71-0","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"i spasili smo ga","en":"and we saved him"},{"bs":"i spašava","en":"and he/it saves"},{"bs":"spasio vas je","en":"he/it saved you (all)"},{"bs":"spasili smo vas","en":"we saved you (all)"}],"ref":"21:71","answerWord":"وَنَجَّيْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/90ca6d3c2680f70444f2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We rescued him and Lot (and brought them) to the land which We have blessed for (all) peoples.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["وَنَجَّيْنَٰهُ","وَلُوطًا","إِلَى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","ٱلَّتِى","بَٰرَكْنَا","فِيهَا","لِلْعَٰلَمِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-26-170-0","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"pa smo ga spasili","en":"so We saved him"},{"bs":"i spašava","en":"and he/it saves"},{"bs":"i spasili smo","en":"and we saved"},{"bs":"spasi me!","en":"save me!"}],"ref":"26:170","answerWord":"فَنَجَّيْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/832ba450eedb88f109b7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So We saved him and his household, every one,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["فَنَجَّيْنَٰهُ","وَأَهْلَهُۥٓ","أَجْمَعِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-26-118-4","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"i spasi me!","en":"and save me!"},{"bs":"i spasili smo ga","en":"and we saved him"},{"bs":"spasio nas je","en":"he/it saved us"},{"bs":"i spasili smo ih","en":"and we saved them"}],"ref":"26:118","answerWord":"وَنَجِّنِى","answerSound":"audio/71bb8b873309c4c10ab7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Therefor judge Thou between us, a (conclusive) judgment, and save me and those believers who are with me.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["فَٱفْتَحْ","بَيْنِى","وَبَيْنَهُمْ","فَتْحًا","وَنَجِّنِى","وَمَن","مَّعِىَ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-6-64-2","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"spašava vas","en":"he/it saves you (all)"},{"bs":"spasio vas je","en":"he/it saved you (all)"},{"bs":"spašavamo te","en":"we save you"},{"bs":"spasi me!","en":"save me!"}],"ref":"6:64","answerWord":"يُنَجِّيكُم","answerSound":"audio/73b2939d63c1ac1185e2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Allah delivereth you from this and from all affliction. Yet ye attribute partners unto Him.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["قُلِ","ٱللَّهُ","يُنَجِّيكُم","مِّنْهَا","وَمِن","كُلِّ","كَرْبٍ","ثُمَّ","أَنتُمْ","تُشْرِكُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-19-72-1","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"spasit ćemo","en":"We will save"},{"bs":"i spasi me!","en":"and save me!"},{"bs":"pa smo te spasili","en":"so we saved you"},{"bs":"i spasili smo ih","en":"and we saved them (two)"}],"ref":"19:72","answerWord":"نُنَجِّى","answerSound":"audio/bcf01bc676df0a18aa02.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then We shall rescue those who kept from evil, and leave the evil-doers crouching there.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","نُنَجِّى","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱتَّقَوا۟","وَّنَذَرُ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ","فِيهَا","جِثِيًّا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-26-169-1","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"spasi me!","en":"save me!"},{"bs":"spasili smo","en":"we saved"},{"bs":"i spašava","en":"and he/it saves"},{"bs":"pa smo ga spasili","en":"so We saved him"}],"ref":"26:169","answerWord":"نَجِّنِى","answerSound":"audio/1c3d986ba179dc9386f7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"My Lord! Save me and my household from what they do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["رَبِّ","نَجِّنِى","وَأَهْلِى","مِمَّا","يَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-29-65-10","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"spasio ih je","en":"he/it saved them"},{"bs":"i spasili smo","en":"and we saved"},{"bs":"spasi me!","en":"save me!"},{"bs":"pa smo te spasili","en":"so we saved you"}],"ref":"29:65","answerWord":"نَجَّىٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/a50a0b9607ea040393bc.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when they mount upon the ships they pray to Allah, making their faith pure for Him only, but when He bringeth them safe to land, behold! they ascribe partners (unto Him),","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["فَإِذَا","رَكِبُوا۟","فِى","ٱلْفُلْكِ","دَعَوُا۟","ٱللَّهَ","مُخْلِصِينَ","لَهُ","ٱلدِّينَ","فَلَمَّا","نَجَّىٰهُمْ","إِلَى","ٱلْبَرِّ","إِذَا","هُمْ","يُشْرِكُونَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-2-49-1","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"spasili smo vas","en":"we saved you (all)"},{"bs":"spasio nas je","en":"he/it saved us"},{"bs":"pa smo te spasili","en":"so we saved you"},{"bs":"i spasili smo ih","en":"and we saved them (two)"}],"ref":"2:49","answerWord":"نَجَّيْنَٰكُم","answerSound":"audio/415450e3d91caf8e821f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (remember) when We did deliver you from Pharaoh's folk, who were afflicting you with dreadful torment, slaying your sons and sparing your women: that was a tremendous trial from your Lord.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","نَجَّيْنَٰكُم","مِّنْ","ءَالِ","فِرْعَوْنَ","يَسُومُونَكُمْ","سُوٓءَ","ٱلْعَذَابِ","يُذَبِّحُونَ","أَبْنَآءَكُمْ","وَيَسْتَحْيُونَ","نِسَآءَكُمْ","وَفِى","ذَٰلِكُم","بَلَآءٌ","مِّن","رَّبِّكُمْ","عَظِيمٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-10-86-0","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"i spasi nas","en":"and save us"},{"bs":"spasio nas je","en":"he/it saved us"},{"bs":"pa smo te spasili","en":"so we saved you"},{"bs":"spasili smo","en":"we saved"}],"ref":"10:86","answerWord":"وَنَجِّنَا","answerSound":"audio/95d150f8f17944ce5ca7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And, of Thy mercy, save us from the folk that disbelieve.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["وَنَجِّنَا","بِرَحْمَتِكَ","مِنَ","ٱلْقَوْمِ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-10-92-1","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"spašavamo te","en":"we save you"},{"bs":"i spašava","en":"and he/it saves"},{"bs":"spasili smo","en":"we saved"},{"bs":"i spasi nas","en":"and save us"}],"ref":"10:92","answerWord":"نُنَجِّيكَ","answerSound":"audio/5501b06802e62905119a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But this day We save thee in thy body that thou mayst be a portent for those after thee. Lo! most of mankind are heedless of Our portents.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["فَٱلْيَوْمَ","نُنَجِّيكَ","بِبَدَنِكَ","لِتَكُونَ","لِمَنْ","خَلْفَكَ","ءَايَةً","وَإِنَّ","كَثِيرًا","مِّنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","عَنْ","ءَايَٰتِنَا","لَغَٰفِلُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-11-58-10","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"i spasili smo ih","en":"and we saved them"},{"bs":"i spasili smo","en":"and we saved"},{"bs":"pa smo te spasili","en":"so we saved you"},{"bs":"i spašava","en":"and he/it saves"}],"ref":"11:58","answerWord":"وَنَجَّيْنَٰهُم","answerSound":"audio/ce5fe967a1e46c30031b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when Our commandment came to pass We saved Hud and those who believed with him by a mercy from Us; We saved them from a harsh doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["وَلَمَّا","جَآءَ","أَمْرُنَا","نَجَّيْنَا","هُودًا","وَٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","مَعَهُۥ","بِرَحْمَةٍ","مِّنَّا","وَنَجَّيْنَٰهُم","مِّنْ","عَذَابٍ","غَلِيظٍ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-12-110-10","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"pa je spašen","en":"so he/it was saved"},{"bs":"i spasili smo ga","en":"and we saved him"},{"bs":"i spasi me!","en":"and save me!"},{"bs":"spašava vas","en":"he/it saves you (all)"}],"ref":"12:110","answerWord":"فَنُجِّىَ","answerSound":"audio/d1beb864c705ee06b461.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Till, when the messengers despaired and thought that they were denied, then came unto them Our help, and whom We would was saved. And Our wrath cannot be warded from the guilty.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["حَتَّىٰٓ","إِذَا","ٱسْتَيْـَٔسَ","ٱلرُّسُلُ","وَظَنُّوٓا۟","أَنَّهُمْ","قَدْ","كُذِبُوا۟","جَآءَهُمْ","نَصْرُنَا","فَنُجِّىَ","مَن","نَّشَآءُ","وَلَا","يُرَدُّ","بَأْسُنَا","عَنِ","ٱلْقَوْمِ","ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-17-67-11","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"spasio vas je","en":"he/it saved you (all)"},{"bs":"i spasili smo ih","en":"and we saved them"},{"bs":"i spasili smo ga","en":"and we saved him"},{"bs":"spašava vas","en":"he/it saves you (all)"}],"ref":"17:67","answerWord":"نَجَّىٰكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/dc7c1f111ac7c4e882e4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when harm toucheth you upon the sea, all unto whom ye cry (for succour) fail save Him (alone), but when He bringeth you safe to land, ye turn away, for man was ever thankless.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","مَسَّكُمُ","ٱلضُّرُّ","فِى","ٱلْبَحْرِ","ضَلَّ","مَن","تَدْعُونَ","إِلَّآ","إِيَّاهُ","فَلَمَّا","نَجَّىٰكُمْ","إِلَى","ٱلْبَرِّ","أَعْرَضْتُمْ","وَكَانَ","ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ","كَفُورًا"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-29-32-9","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"zaista ćemo ga spasiti","en":"surely we will save him"},{"bs":"spasio ih je","en":"he/it saved them"},{"bs":"pa je spašen","en":"so he/it was saved"},{"bs":"i spasili smo ih","en":"and we saved them"}],"ref":"29:32","answerWord":"لَنُنَجِّيَنَّهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/595c0acf14355b107847.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Lo! Lot is there. They said: We are best aware of who is there. We are to deliver him and his household, all save his wife, who is of those who stay behind.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["قَالَ","إِنَّ","فِيهَا","لُوطًا","قَالُوا۟","نَحْنُ","أَعْلَمُ","بِمَن","فِيهَا","لَنُنَجِّيَنَّهُۥ","وَأَهْلَهُۥٓ","إِلَّا","ٱمْرَأَتَهُۥ","كَانَتْ","مِنَ","ٱلْغَٰبِرِينَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-37-115-0","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"i spasili smo ih","en":"and we saved them (two)"},{"bs":"spasio nas je","en":"he/it saved us"},{"bs":"i spasili smo","en":"and we saved"},{"bs":"pa smo te spasili","en":"so we saved you"}],"ref":"37:115","answerWord":"وَنَجَّيْنَٰهُمَا","answerSound":"audio/e4250d9be86d9e228198.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And saved them and their people from the great distress,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["وَنَجَّيْنَٰهُمَا","وَقَوْمَهُمَا","مِنَ","ٱلْكَرْبِ","ٱلْعَظِيمِ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-37-134-1","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"spasili smo ga","en":"we saved him"},{"bs":"spasi me!","en":"save me!"},{"bs":"spasio nas je","en":"he/it saved us"},{"bs":"spašavamo te","en":"we save you"}],"ref":"37:134","answerWord":"نَجَّيْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/66b757c8eae7a0c71110.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When We saved him and his household, every one,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["إِذْ","نَجَّيْنَٰهُ","وَأَهْلَهُۥٓ","أَجْمَعِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-39-61-0","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"i spašava","en":"and he/it saves"},{"bs":"pa je spašen","en":"so he/it was saved"},{"bs":"i spasili smo ih","en":"and we saved them"},{"bs":"spasio ih je","en":"he/it saved them"}],"ref":"39:61","answerWord":"وَيُنَجِّى","answerSound":"audio/033389b6190df3a428a1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Allah delivereth those who ward off (evil) because of their deserts. Evil toucheth them not, nor do they grieve.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["وَيُنَجِّى","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱتَّقَوْا۟","بِمَفَازَتِهِمْ","لَا","يَمَسُّهُمُ","ٱلسُّوٓءُ","وَلَا","هُمْ","يَحْزَنُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-41-18-0","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"i spasili smo","en":"and we saved"},{"bs":"spašavamo te","en":"we save you"},{"bs":"spasi me!","en":"save me!"},{"bs":"i spasili smo ih","en":"and we saved them (two)"}],"ref":"41:18","answerWord":"وَنَجَّيْنَا","answerSound":"audio/9de0447a21eacb43e5e8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We delivered those who believed and used to keep their duty to Allah.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["وَنَجَّيْنَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَكَانُوا۟","يَتَّقُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"najja-54-34-7","words":["verb:najja"],"options":[{"bs":"spasili smo ih","en":"we saved them"},{"bs":"pa je spašen","en":"so he/it was saved"},{"bs":"i spasi nas","en":"and save us"},{"bs":"i spasili smo ih","en":"and we saved them (two)"}],"ref":"54:34","answerWord":"نَّجَّيْنَٰهُم","answerSound":"audio/e2c93cd3c8efa7ca21da.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! We sent a storm of stones upon them (all) save the family of Lot, whom We rescued in the last watch of the night,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"spasiti","en":"to save, to rescue"},"passage":["إِنَّآ","أَرْسَلْنَا","عَلَيْهِمْ","حَاصِبًا","إِلَّآ","ءَالَ","لُوطٍ","نَّجَّيْنَٰهُم","بِسَحَرٍ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"نَجَّى"}},{"id":"idtarra-2-173-13","words":["verb:idtarra"],"options":[{"bs":"prisiljen je","en":"he/it was compelled"},{"bs":"natjerat ćemo ih","en":"We will compel them"},{"bs":"prisiljeni ste","en":"you (all) were compelled"},{"bs":"prisiljavam ga","en":"I compel him"}],"ref":"2:173","answerWord":"ٱضْطُرَّ","answerSound":"audio/8f9c95a443fd18a1ed5d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He hath forbidden you only carrion, and blood, and swineflesh, and that which hath been immolated to (the name of) any other than Allah. But he who is driven by necessity, neither craving nor transgressing, it is no sin for him. Lo! Allah is Forgiving, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prisiliti, natjerati","en":"to compel, to force"},"passage":["إِنَّمَا","حَرَّمَ","عَلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْمَيْتَةَ","وَٱلدَّمَ","وَلَحْمَ","ٱلْخِنزِيرِ","وَمَآ","أُهِلَّ","بِهِۦ","لِغَيْرِ","ٱللَّهِ","فَمَنِ","ٱضْطُرَّ","غَيْرَ","بَاغٍ","وَلَا","عَادٍ","فَلَآ","إِثْمَ","عَلَيْهِ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","غَفُورٌ","رَّحِيمٌ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"اضْطَرَّ"}},{"id":"idtarra-2-126-24","words":["verb:idtarra"],"options":[{"bs":"prisiljavam ga","en":"I compel him"},{"bs":"prisiljen je","en":"he/it was compelled"},{"bs":"natjerat ćemo ih","en":"We will compel them"},{"bs":"prisiljeni ste","en":"you (all) were compelled"}],"ref":"2:126","answerWord":"أَضْطَرُّهُۥٓ","answerSound":"audio/3376c7f2bd5591306e76.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when Abraham prayed: My Lord! Make this a region of security and bestow upon its people fruits, such of them as believe in Allah and the Last Day, He answered: As for him who disbelieveth, I shall leave him in contentment for a while, then I shall compel him to the doom of Fire - a hapless journey's end!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prisiliti, natjerati","en":"to compel, to force"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قَالَ","إِبْرَٰهِۦمُ","رَبِّ","ٱجْعَلْ","هَٰذَا","بَلَدًا","ءَامِنًا","وَٱرْزُقْ","أَهْلَهُۥ","مِنَ","ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ","مَنْ","ءَامَنَ","مِنْهُم","بِٱللَّهِ","وَٱلْيَوْمِ","ٱلْءَاخِرِ","قَالَ","وَمَن","كَفَرَ","فَأُمَتِّعُهُۥ","قَلِيلًا","ثُمَّ","أَضْطَرُّهُۥٓ","إِلَىٰ","عَذَابِ","ٱلنَّارِ","وَبِئْسَ","ٱلْمَصِيرُ"],"marked":[24],"facts":{"verb":"اضْطَرَّ"}},{"id":"idtarra-6-119-17","words":["verb:idtarra"],"options":[{"bs":"prisiljeni ste","en":"you (all) were compelled"},{"bs":"prisiljavam ga","en":"I compel him"},{"bs":"natjerat ćemo ih","en":"We will compel them"},{"bs":"prisiljen je","en":"he/it was compelled"}],"ref":"6:119","answerWord":"ٱضْطُرِرْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/76ac31b2e7abedf78c21.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"How should ye not eat of that over which the name of Allah hath been mentioned, when He hath explained unto you that which is forbidden unto you unless ye are compelled thereto. But lo! many are led astray by their own lusts through ignorance. Lo! thy Lord, He is Best Aware of the transgressors.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prisiliti, natjerati","en":"to compel, to force"},"passage":["وَمَا","لَكُمْ","أَلَّا","تَأْكُلُوا۟","مِمَّا","ذُكِرَ","ٱسْمُ","ٱللَّهِ","عَلَيْهِ","وَقَدْ","فَصَّلَ","لَكُم","مَّا","حَرَّمَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","إِلَّا","مَا","ٱضْطُرِرْتُمْ","إِلَيْهِ","وَإِنَّ","كَثِيرًا","لَّيُضِلُّونَ","بِأَهْوَآئِهِم","بِغَيْرِ","عِلْمٍ","إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","هُوَ","أَعْلَمُ","بِٱلْمُعْتَدِينَ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"اضْطَرَّ"}},{"id":"idtarra-31-24-3","words":["verb:idtarra"],"options":[{"bs":"natjerat ćemo ih","en":"We will compel them"},{"bs":"prisiljeni ste","en":"you (all) were compelled"},{"bs":"prisiljavam ga","en":"I compel him"},{"bs":"prisiljen je","en":"he/it was compelled"}],"ref":"31:24","answerWord":"نَضْطَرُّهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/b2e1b6e2f7065c130902.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We give them comfort for a little, and then We drive them to a heavy doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prisiliti, natjerati","en":"to compel, to force"},"passage":["نُمَتِّعُهُمْ","قَلِيلًا","ثُمَّ","نَضْطَرُّهُمْ","إِلَىٰ","عَذَابٍ","غَلِيظٍ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"اضْطَرَّ"}},{"id":"akraha-16-106-8","words":["verb:akraha"],"options":[{"bs":"prisiljen je","en":"he/it was compelled"},{"bs":"prisilio si nas","en":"you compelled us"},{"bs":"prisiljava ih","en":"he/it compels them"},{"bs":"prisiljavate","en":"you (all) compel"}],"ref":"16:106","answerWord":"أُكْرِهَ","answerSound":"audio/3a85302be1fb7b10c6bc.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Whoso disbelieveth in Allah after his belief - save him who is forced thereto and whose heart is still content with the Faith - but whoso findeth ease in disbelief: On them is wrath from Allah. Theirs will be an awful doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prisiliti, natjerati","en":"to compel, to force"},"passage":["مَن","كَفَرَ","بِٱللَّهِ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","إِيمَٰنِهِۦٓ","إِلَّا","مَنْ","أُكْرِهَ","وَقَلْبُهُۥ","مُطْمَئِنٌّۢ","بِٱلْإِيمَٰنِ","وَلَٰكِن","مَّن","شَرَحَ","بِٱلْكُفْرِ","صَدْرًا","فَعَلَيْهِمْ","غَضَبٌ","مِّنَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَلَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","عَظِيمٌ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"أَكْرَهَ"}},{"id":"akraha-20-73-7","words":["verb:akraha"],"options":[{"bs":"prisilio si nas","en":"you compelled us"},{"bs":"prisiljava ih","en":"he/it compels them"},{"bs":"prisiljen je","en":"he/it was compelled"},{"bs":"prisiljavate","en":"you (all) compel"}],"ref":"20:73","answerWord":"أَكْرَهْتَنَا","answerSound":"audio/ec938c77729beff9077e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! we believe in our Lord, that He may forgive us our sins and the magic unto which thou didst force us. Allah is better and more lasting.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prisiliti, natjerati","en":"to compel, to force"},"passage":["إِنَّآ","ءَامَنَّا","بِرَبِّنَا","لِيَغْفِرَ","لَنَا","خَطَٰيَٰنَا","وَمَآ","أَكْرَهْتَنَا","عَلَيْهِ","مِنَ","ٱلسِّحْرِ","وَٱللَّهُ","خَيْرٌ","وَأَبْقَىٰٓ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"أَكْرَهَ"}}]